    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75155" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρμέω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅρμος</span> II) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be
